 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Out in the desert every morning there was bread upon the ground",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Thin and flaky, fine as frost, and not a soul went without",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.97,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Even when they grumbled and they turned their hearts around",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.96,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Every single morning there was manna to be found",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The LORD's acts of mercy never cease",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His compassions never come to an end",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They are new every morning",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Great is your faithfulness",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.87,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "LORD, your mercy reaches to the heavens",
