   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Your faithfulness to the clouds",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Peter swore he'd never leave him, but he warmed his hands that night",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "By a fire in the courtyard he denied him three times",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then beside the lake one morning, in the early light so pale",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
